From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:08:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Screen guard: also protect the results/answers view, stronger
 watermark

The guard only ran while a student was taking the exercise. The review
screen that follows shows every question with the correct answers, and
it had no protection at all.

- mount ScreenGuard on the results view
- watermark: readable on light and dark theme (was 7% near-black), now
  covers the whole screen (260 repeats instead of 40) and includes the
  time as well as the name and date
- withGuardPausedAsync(): opening the native share sheet no longer
  counts as a screenshot attempt
